{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31019","headline":"闻官军破吉浪戎小而固虑史氏遗忽因记爲二章 一 · 薛能","name":"闻官军破吉浪戎小而固虑史氏遗忽因记爲二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一战便抽兵，蛮孤吉浪平。\n通连无旧穴，要害有新城。\n昼卒烽前寝，春农界上耕。\n高楼一拟望，新雨劒南清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}